## APPLICATIONS

1. Customer App (Expo + Expo Router)

- Splash screen + onboarding (first-time users)
- OTP login (Supabase Auth)
- Vendor listing (approved vendors only)
- Book cleaning service (date + time slot)
- AMC subscription plans (monthly, quarterly)
- Booking history
- Upcoming services
- Profile & address management

2. Technician App (Expo + Expo Router)

- Login (Supabase Auth)
- View assigned jobs
- Enter booking code for verification
- Complete safety checklist before starting job
- Start job timer
- Upload before cleaning photo (Supabase Storage)
- Upload after cleaning photo (Supabase Storage)
- Submit job completion report

3. Admin Web App (React + Vite)

- Vendor onboarding approval workflow
- View and manage bookings
- Monitor vendor performance
- Assign default vendors (fallback logic)
- View reports and analytics (MIS)

---

## CORE FEATURES

VENDOR ONBOARDING:

- Vendors and technicians register with documents
- Data stored in Supabase tables
- Admin reviews and approves/rejects vendors
- Only approved vendors are visible to customers

CUSTOMER BOOKING:

- Customer selects vendor and time slot
- Booking request is stored in Supabase
- Vendor must accept within 1 hour
- Booking code is generated after acceptance

VENDOR FLOW:

- Vendor receives booking request
- Assigns technician (Oorja Man)
- Confirms operational readiness
- Confirms safety compliance before accepting

TECHNICIAN FLOW:

- Technician enters booking code from customer
- Must confirm safety checklist
- Starts job → timer begins
- Uploads before/after photos to Supabase Storage
- Submits completion report

---

## AMC / SUBSCRIPTIONS

- Customers can subscribe to recurring cleaning plans

- Plans include:
  - Monthly
  - Quarterly
  - Custom frequency

- Each subscription includes:
  - Start date
  - Frequency (in days)
  - Next service date
  - Status (active / paused / cancelled)

- System automatically:
  - Generates bookings for upcoming services
  - Updates next service date after completion

- Users can:
  - Pause subscription
  - Resume subscription
  - Cancel subscription

---

## BUSINESS LOGIC

VENDOR VISIBILITY:

- Only vendors with status = "approved" are visible

BOOKING ACCEPTANCE:

- Vendor must accept within 1 hour

FALLBACK LOGIC:

- If vendor does not accept, system assigns default vendor

BOOKING TIME RULE:

- If booking is placed after 7 PM,
  earliest slot = next day after 12 PM

BOOKING CODE:

- Generated after vendor acceptance
- Required for technician to start job

