## SUPABASE USAGE (CRITICAL)

Authentication:

- Use Supabase Auth (OTP-based login)
- Roles stored in database (not in Auth metadata)

Database:

- PostgreSQL (Supabase)
- All tables must be created in OorjaManDB

Storage:

- Use Supabase Storage for:
  - Before cleaning images
  - After cleaning images
  - Vendor documents (Aadhaar, PAN, etc.)

Security:

- Use Row Level Security (RLS) on all tables
- Enforce role-based access:
  - customer
  - vendor
  - technician
  - admin

API:

- All frontend apps must use Supabase client from packages/api
- Do NOT create custom backend servers

